OL,3,GNEWSAFemale welder challenges 'sexism
OL,4,Ain industry'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA welder with more than 30 years
OL,7,Fexperience said she once lost out on a
OL,8,Fjob due to a lack of women's toilets.
OL,10,FMel Stewart, from Bedlington, in
OL,11,FNorthumberland, said her career has
OL,12,Fbeen littered with bullying, sexism and
OL,13,Frejection but is now trying to change
OL,14,Fthe old-guard.
OL,16,FThe 50-year-old set up her own company
OL,17,Fabout a year ago and wants to encourage
OL,18,Fmore women into the sector to help
OL,19,Ffight the growing shortage.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,395,390,260,160,0,100
