OL,3,GNEWSAFemale welder challenges 'sexism
OL,4,Ain industry'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I had to get my own business to become
OL,7,Fthe person I want to be, because I've
OL,8,Fhad so many businesses where I could
OL,9,Fhave been a director but I was never
OL,10,Fgiven the opportunity," Stewart said.
